from pydantic.fields import Field", "replace": "from pydantic import BaseModel, ConfigDict, Field", "explanation": "Import Field from the top-level pydantic package, which is the public v2 location, instead of the internal pydantic.fields module. ModelField is not used in this file."}, {"finding_ids": ["pydantic_cli/examples/simple_with_boolean_custom.py:30:deprecated-field-extra"], "search": "    input_file3: str = Field(
        ..., description="Path to input H5 file", cli=("-f", "--hdf5")
    )", "replace": "    input_file3: str = Field(
        ...,
        description="Path to input H5 file",
        json_schema_extra={"cli": ("-f", "--hdf5")},
    )", "explanation": "Pydantic v2 deprecates extra keyword arguments on Field (the 'cli' key). Per the migration guide, custom metadata must go in json_schema_extra. The value is unchanged."}, {"finding_ids": ["pydantic_cli/examples/simple_with_boolean_custom.py:30:deprecated-field-extra"], "search": "        cli=("-b", "--beta-filter"),", "replace": "        json_schema_extra={"cli": ("-b", "--beta-filter")},", "explanation": "Move the deprecated Field extra 'cli' kwarg into json_schema_extra, as required by Pydantic v2 (Field extra kwargs are deprecated). Value is unchanged."}, {"finding_ids": ["pydantic_cli/examples/simple_with_boolean_custom.py:30:deprecated-field-extra"], "search": "        cli=("--epsilon", "--disable-epsilon"),", "replace": "        json_schema_extra={"cli": ("--epsilon", "--disable-epsilon")},", "explanation": "Move the deprecated Field extra 'cli' kwarg into json_schema_extra, as required by Pydantic v2. Value is unchanged."}], "notes": "Findings already satisfied in the current content, so no edit was made: the class Config was already replaced by model_config = ConfigDict(...) (config-class), and outfile and gamma already have `= None` defaults (optional-no-default). The file does not use ModelField. The failing collection errors come from the Field(..., cli=...) kwargs in input_file3, beta_filter, and epsilon; these are now moved into json_schema_extra. Cross-file dependency: pydantic_cli/core.py (also in the migration list) must read the flag from field.json_schema_extra["cli"] instead of field.extra["cli"], or the CLI flags will silently stop working. Not verified: model_config = ConfigDict(**{...vars(DefaultConfig)...}) unpacks DefaultConfig from pydantic_cli/core.py; if DefaultConfig contains v1-only keys, that needs a check in core.py. The v2 deprecation is a warning rather than an error for `Field(..., cli=...)`, but the test failure shows the suite treats it as one, so the migration to json_schema_extra is required."}
